@* حوار إضافة مستخدم جديد (البريد يُستخدم كاسم مستخدم ليتوافق مع شاشة تسجيل الدخول) *@
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResources> Loc

<MudDialog>
    <TitleContent>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">@Loc["AddUser"]</MudText>
    </TitleContent>
    <DialogContent>
        <MudForm @ref="_form">
            @if (_error is not null)
            {
                <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Class="mb-3">@_error</MudAlert>
            }

            <MudTextField @bind-Value="_email" Label="@Loc["Email"]" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                          Required="true" RequiredError="@Loc["RequiredField"]" />
            <MudTextField @bind-Value="_password" Label="@Loc["Password"]" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                          InputType="InputType.Password" Required="true" RequiredError="@Loc["RequiredField"]" />
            <MudTextField @bind-Value="_confirmPassword" Label="@Loc["ConfirmPassword"]" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                          InputType="InputType.Password" Required="true" RequiredError="@Loc["RequiredField"]" />

            <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2" Class="mt-3 mb-1">@Loc["Roles"]</MudText>
            @foreach (var role in _allRoles)
            {
                <MudCheckBox T="bool" Checked="@_selected[role.Name]" CheckedChanged="@((bool v) => _selected[role.Name] = v)" Label="@role.Name" />
            }
        </MudForm>
    </DialogContent>
    <DialogActions>
        <MudButton OnClick="Cancel" Color="Color.Default">@Loc["Cancel"]</MudButton>
        <MudButton OnClick="SaveAsync" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary">@Loc["Save"]</MudButton>
    </DialogActions>
</MudDialog>

@code {
    [CascadingParameter] private IMudDialogInstance MudDialog { get; set; } = default!;

    [Parameter] public IUserService UserService { get; set; } = default!;
    [Parameter] public IRoleService RoleService { get; set; } = default!;

    private MudForm? _form;
    private string _email = string.Empty;
    private string _password = string.Empty;
    private string _confirmPassword = string.Empty;
    private string? _error;
    private List<RoleDto> _allRoles = new();
    private readonly Dictionary<string, bool> _selected = new();

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        try
        {
            _allRoles = await RoleService.GetRolesAsync();
            foreach (var role in _allRoles)
                _selected[role.Name] = false;
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = ex.Message; }
    }

    private void Cancel() => MudDialog.Cancel();

    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        await _form!.Validate();
        if (!_form.IsValid) return;

        if (_password != _confirmPassword)
        {
            _error = Loc["PasswordsDoNotMatch"];
            return;
        }

        _error = null;
        try
        {
            var roles = _selected.Where(kv => kv.Value).Select(kv => kv.Key).ToList();
            // البريد يُستخدم كاسم مستخدم ليتمكن المستخدم من تسجيل الدخول به
            await UserService.CreateUserAsync(_email.Trim(), _email.Trim(), _password, roles);
            MudDialog.Close(DialogResult.Ok(true));
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = ex.Message; }
    }
}